s=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: dodgerblue\"><b>Average</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: red\"><b>Bad</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.85.11485<br/>January 07, 2022<br/>25<sup>th</sup> Anniversary Update</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nIn this dungeon you'll travel through Tibia's history, starting at version 12.80 until the very early days of Tibia when only the city of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> existed. On each area you'll find one or two creatures corresponding to the update they were implemented in, as well as references to other content implemented in that time.\n</p><p>The entrance of the dungeon is through a time machine located under Thais' wall, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32429,32168,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32429, 32168, 8)</a>.\n</p><p>This is the main area of the <a href=\"#/quest/25-years-of-tibia-quest\">25 Years of Tibia Quest</a>.\n</p><p>All of the monsters have normalized stats, so don't be surprised! Whether it's a <a href=\"#/wiki/Poisonous%20Carnisylvan\">Carnisylvan</a> or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolf</a> they have similar strength to each other.\nAs a hunting place, this location may be of interest mainly for FACC players with level 100+, as the exp/h is fairly representative for such a level range.\nMoreover, as most of the locations contains only one kind of a monster at a time, their weaknesses may be exploited even by lower level characters.\nHowever, the mobs drop mostly gold, basic supplies, and only sometimes jewelry – thus the hunt would be at loss most of the times.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Forest_of_Life.2C_Lion_Sanctum_and_Kilmaresh\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Forest_of_Life,_Lion_Sanctum_and_Kilmaresh\">Forest of Life, Lion Sanctum and Kilmaresh</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20a%20Carnisylvan\"><img alt=\"Memory of a Carnisylvan\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Memory_of_a_Carnisylvan_942c16.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20a%20Carnisylvan\">Memory of a Carnisylvan</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,850</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">3,800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">400</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-100× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>Mushroom Pie</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Spirit%20Potion\">Great Spirit Potion</a></li>\n<li>1-3× Fire Mushroom</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a></li>\n<li>Wooden 